United Nations (UN), note: Tracking SDG 7: The Energy Progress Report, publisher: UN Statistics Division;
World Bank (WB), note: Tracking SDG 7: The Energy Progress Report;
World Health Organization (WHO), note: Tracking SDG 7: The Energy Progress Report

Access to clean fuels and technologies for cooking, urban is the proportion of urban population primarily using clean cooking fuels and technologies for cooking. Under WHO guidelines, kerosene is excluded from clean cooking fuels. Original provider: Tracking SDG 7: The Energy Progress Report, International Energy Agency (IEA), note: License: Creative Commons Attribution—NonCommercial 3.0 IGO (CC BY-NC 3.0 IGO);
